    "text": "1 days ago Kick off fall with a fresh lineup of stylish, practical and fun finds! Lifestyle and parenting contributor Sherri French highlights seasonal essentials, including men’s and women’s sweaters from Express, the multichannel apparel brand known for modern, effortless style. Baggallini has teamed up with supermodel Coco Rocha for its first celebrity collaboration, a six-piece capsule designed for life on the go, with bags featuring compartments for everything from laptops to water bottles. Read full article",
